The example Documents in this folder are shared under the licences named
below, each with its source and attribution. The rest of IncarnaMind is under
its own licence (Apache-2.0); this folder's licence list covers these files
only. Every Document here may be redistributed with the app; nothing is
included whose licence or legal status could not be confirmed on its source
page.

How the files differ from the originals: unless a Document says otherwise, its
text is unchanged. Where a PDF is an excerpt, the pages kept are named. To keep
the app small, the images inside the PDFs were recompressed (JPEG) and the PDFs
rewritten; no words were changed. File names were shortened to the names shown.

Licences: CC BY 4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
          CC BY 3.0 IGO https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/legalcode
          CC BY-SA 4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
          The Chinese reports have no licence: see their section.


=== Draft: credit committee paper (credit/en/ and credit/zh-CN/) ===

Written for IncarnaMind's example note by the IncarnaMind authors, and
shared under CC BY 4.0. Northwind Retail and Aldermoor Bank are fictional:
the documents describe no real company or agreement.

- credit/en/"Northwind Retail · Q3 2026 results.pdf"
- credit/en/"Northwind Retail · Senior facilities agreement (excerpt).pdf"
- credit/zh-CN/"Northwind Retail · 2026 年第三季度业绩.pdf"
- credit/zh-CN/"Northwind Retail · 优先级贷款协议（节选）.pdf"

The Chinese documents were written in Chinese, not translated. The PDFs
embed subsets of Source Sans 3 and Noto Sans SC, each under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). Their pages are in
scripts/exampleDocuments, which `npm run examples:credit:print` prints.


